cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research or its materials, please cite the archived release."
title: "Solo Titania Chaos: artistic research, studio process and production dossier"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Petkova
    given-names: Tatiana
abstract: >-
  A multilingual, versioned research and production dossier for Solo Titania
  Chaos, a physical, wordless clown solo investigating solitude, audience
  presence, failure and connection. The repository contains the artistic
  concept, studio methodology, research ledger, project journal, ethics and
  consent materials, and production planning.
repository-code: "https://github.com/titaniachaos/clown"
url: "https://titaniachaos.com/clown/"
keywords:
  - artistic research
  - clown
  - performing arts
  - physical theatre
  - solitude
  - audience relationship
  - practice-based research

